  "prefLabel": "Per 102.96 Temporary fill-in assignment",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Per 102.96 “Temporary fill-in assignment” means an assignment of a candidate who is not a full-time employee in the classified service at the time of assignment to a full-time classified position that is vacant because the incumbent is on military leave, extended leave without pay, or because of difficulties with recruitment.\n\nSource. #5373, eff 4-27-92; ss by #6729, eff 4-21-98; renumbered by #10238 (Per 102.62); renumbered by #10801 (from Per 102.64); ss by #13667, eff 6-22-23 (formerly Per 102.70); renumbered by #14065-A; renumbered by #14132-A; ss by #14434 (formerly Per 102.86), eff 12-1-25",
